[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#C0392B]Buyer fit (read before purchase)[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
A few hard requirements. If any are a [B]no[/B], EssentialsX [I]/rtp[/I] or HuskHomes are solid free alternatives that will probably serve you better.

[LIST]
[*][B]Java 21+[/B] on your host (REQ-RTP-SYS-001, non-negotiable).
[*][B]Paper, Folia, Spigot, or Fabric[/B] - or Arclight / Mohist for Forge / NeoForge.
[*][B]You edit YAML.[/B] No GUI by design - plain files you can version and diff.
[*][B]You read the admin guide before asking for help.[/B] Support Policy is enforced (see below).
[*][B]Real server, not a 2-player LAN.[/B] For a friends-only SMP this is overkill - grab the free build.
[/LIST]

